      "text": "Elon showing Jay Leno the first production unit Tesla Roadster in 2008.\n\nLeno amazed by battery pack with 6,831 lithium-ion cells and gives this take on his first test drive: \n\n“The good thing with electricity is that you get full torque from 0 RPM. In a gas car, you have to bring the revs to 3 or 4 grand and pop the clutch. Most electric cars feel bottom heavy, but not this. It’s eerily quiet. It’s amazing. All you hear is the wind noise. I like that it’s a sports car, not some dorky little 4-door econo-box.”\n\n***\n\nFull ep: https://youtu.be/jjZf9sgdDKc?si=Ulfq2dUvwVLJ09Zr"
